# Line endings are pinned rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf.
#
# This is a Windows-only PowerShell/WPF project: the launcher is a .bat (which
# genuinely requires CRLF), and the sources are CRLF on disk. Without this file
# the working tree depends on a per-machine git setting, so two developers can
# see different diffs for a file neither of them edited.
#
# NOTE: this governs line endings only. It does NOT affect the UTF-8 BOM that
# every .ps1 and .xaml under src\ must carry - a BOM sits at the start of the
# file, not at the end of a line. build.ps1 remains the gate for that.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
